{{!
    @template tool_vae/organisation_cell

    What a cell of the tables of the organisation holds: a row of inline parts, the fold of a count of activities over its
    list, a list of items made of parts, the sentence that says a list of plans may be incomplete, or the label of a
    competency line. Side by side with no space between them: a comment carries each line break of the template.

    Every text comes from the context, worded by tool_vae\output\organisation_cell; the template holds no logic beyond its
    sections. Every text, label, address and class is escaped (double braces). Two keys are HTML, placed as they are (triple
    braces): texthtml and labelhtml, made by the core (format_string() of the name of a template or a course, the names of
    the roles given by role_get_names(), the names of a course and an activity formatted by the core in the data, and the
    sentence "forbidden by" whose parameter is those names).

    Each kind of part is an object, never a bare string: a section that tested the string itself would draw nothing for
    the text "0", which Mustache holds for empty. isbloc is a boolean, never written.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * parts - array of parts, each with the seven keys below, one of them set and the others false:
        * text - false, or {label}: a text
        * html - false, or {texthtml}: HTML made by the core
        * link - false, or {url, label}: a link
        * linkhtml - false, or {url, labelhtml}: a link whose words are HTML made by the core
        * span - false, or {class, label}: a span with its classes
        * strong - false, or {label}: a text in bold
        * code - false, or {label}: a name of the code, small
    * details - null, or {title, label, fichecode}: the fold over the list, its summary and the record said to a screen reader
    * list - null, or {class, items}: each item a row of parts as above
    * partial - null, or {label}: the sentence under a list of plans that may be incomplete
    * competency - null, or {label, gone, isbloc, tag}: the label of a competency line, gone null or {label}

    Example context (json):
    {
        "parts": [
            {"text": false, "html": false, "link": false, "linkhtml": false,
                "span": {"class": "badge bg-warning text-dark", "label": "Missing"}, "strong": false, "code": false},
            {"text": {"label": " Nobody gives it."}, "html": false, "link": false, "linkhtml": false, "span": false,
                "strong": false, "code": false},
            {"text": false, "html": false, "link": false, "linkhtml": false, "span": false, "strong": {"label": "RNCP100"},
                "code": false},
            {"text": false, "html": {"texthtml": "Direction"}, "link": false, "linkhtml": false, "span": false,
                "strong": false, "code": {"label": "tool/vae:viewany"} }
        ],
        "details": {"title": "List of the activities", "label": "2 activities", "fichecode": "RNCP100"},
        "list": {"class": "list-unstyled mb-0", "items": [
            {"parts": [
                {"text": false, "html": false, "link": false,
                    "linkhtml": {"url": "https://example.com/course/view.php?id=2", "labelhtml": "Cours AES"},
                    "span": false, "strong": false, "code": false},
                {"text": {"label": " › "}, "html": false,
                    "link": {"url": "https://example.com/mod/quiz/view.php?id=7", "label": "Quiz"},
                    "linkhtml": false, "span": false, "strong": false, "code": false}
            ]}
        ]},
        "partial": {"label": "The list may be incomplete."},
        "competency": {"label": "RNCP100-BC01 — Bloc 1", "gone": null, "isbloc": true, "tag": "(bloc)"}
    }
}}
{{#parts}}{{#text}}{{label}}{{/text}}{{#html}}{{{texthtml}}}{{/html}}{{!
}}{{#link}}<a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>{{/link}}{{#linkhtml}}<a href="{{url}}">{{{labelhtml}}}</a>{{/linkhtml}}{{!
}}{{#span}}<span class="{{class}}">{{label}}</span>{{/span}}{{#strong}}<strong>{{label}}</strong>{{/strong}}{{!
}}{{#code}}<code class="small">{{label}}</code>{{/code}}{{/parts}}{{!
}}{{#details}}<details><summary title="{{title}}">{{label}}{{!
}}<span class="visually-hidden"> {{fichecode}}</span></summary>{{/details}}{{!
}}{{#list}}<ul class="{{class}}">{{#items}}<li>{{#parts}}{{#text}}{{label}}{{/text}}{{#html}}{{{texthtml}}}{{/html}}{{!
}}{{#link}}<a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>{{/link}}{{#linkhtml}}<a href="{{url}}">{{{labelhtml}}}</a>{{/linkhtml}}{{!
}}{{#span}}<span class="{{class}}">{{label}}</span>{{/span}}{{#strong}}<strong>{{label}}</strong>{{/strong}}{{!
}}{{#code}}<code class="small">{{label}}</code>{{/code}}{{/parts}}</li>{{/items}}</ul>{{/list}}{{!
}}{{#details}}</details>{{/details}}{{!
}}{{#partial}}<p class="mb-0 text-muted">{{label}}</p>{{/partial}}{{!
}}{{#competency}}{{#isbloc}}<strong>{{label}}{{#gone}}<div class="small">{{label}}</div>{{/gone}}</strong> {{!
}}<span class="small text-muted">{{tag}}</span>{{/isbloc}}{{!
}}{{^isbloc}}{{label}}{{#gone}}<div class="small">{{label}}</div>{{/gone}}{{/isbloc}}{{/competency}}
